  description: '(This card is always treated as "Fallen of Albaz".)

    If this
    card is in your hand: You can send 1 monster that mentions "Fallen of Albaz"
    from your Extra Deck to the GY; Special Summon this card, also you cannot Special
    Summon from the Extra Deck for the rest of this turn, except Level 8 Fusion or
    Synchro Monsters. If this card is Normal or Special Summoned: You can Special
    Summon 1 "Ecclesia" monster from your hand, Deck, or GY. You can only use each
    effect of "Fallen of the White Dragon" once per turn.'
